   {
    "text": "An online survey collected 5,957 completed responses between 28 March and 9 May 2025 from state government and hospital and health service employees.",
    "cites": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.ccc.qld.gov.au/sites/default/files/Docs/Publications/CCC/CPS25-Public-Sector-Employee-Report.pdf",
